THE CHARGER'S EFFICIENCY BY OPERATING POINT (efficiency.py, stream s117 second issue, MESHSAT-1357). Desk arithmetic
on the makers' figures (SLUSE66A Equations 6 to 22); nothing built or measured. Core loss, board copper and PFM EXCLUDED:
every figure is high by them. Readings: lower = the makers' maxima; TI = Equation 14 with typical figures; Qgs2; upper.

